    ? 'A non-refundable advance payment of 30% of the total invoice value is required prior to commencement of production. The remaining balance of 70% is payable in full before dispatch of goods. Orders exceeding USD 5,000 must be settled exclusively via Telegraphic Transfer (TT / Wire Transfer).'
    : 'A non-refundable advance payment of 30% of the total invoice value is required prior to commencement of production. The remaining balance of 70% is payable in full before dispatch of goods. Payment is accepted via WorldRemit mobile wallet transfer or Telegraphic Transfer (TT).';
